+---
+id: pthm-qftx-oraifeartaigh-f-term-breaking
+kind: physics-theorem
+title: Exact tree-level minimum in the three-field O’Raifeartaigh model
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 5
