+---
+id: lem-qftx-real-part-modulus-bound-equality
+kind: lemma
+title: Ordered-field component bound with its equality case
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
