+    - title: "Adel Bilal, Introduction to Supersymmetry"
+      url: "https://arxiv.org/pdf/hep-th/0101055"
+      locator: "§6.1, printed pp. 35–36: the vacuum energy as a sum of supercharge norms and the vanishing-energy criterion."
+verification:
